(7690159, 1259718, 114285, '<td valign="top">My favourite for the challenge, excellently photographed. This could always be in the news IMHO. Your editing is superb also. Should ribbon.</td>', 'My favourite for the challenge, excellently photographed. This could always be in the news IMHO. Your editing is superb also. Should ribbon.', '2021-03-23 02:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690209, 1259926, 173844, '<td valign="top">A real news event photographed beautifully.  It''s structured in such a way as to suggest a phalanx of massive buildings opposing nature.  And, no way.  The palette is perfect, somber, drab even.  The receding immense spread is superb.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A real news event photographed beautifully.  It''s structured in such a way as to suggest a phalanx of massive buildings opposing nature.  And, no way.  The palette is perfect, somber, drab even.  The receding immense spread is superb.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-23 22:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690210, 1259754, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s great to match what I''ve read to the actual phenomenon.  It''s serious stuff, but you''ve managed to find the fairy tale version.  I''m in awe of how it plays out in this particular scene.  Beautiful blues, pinks, tans and yellows.  Nice handling of the buildings and their reflections.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'It''s great to match what I''ve read to the actual phenomenon.  It''s serious stuff, but you''ve managed to find the fairy tale version.  I''m in awe of how it plays out in this particular scene.  Beautiful blues, pinks, tans and yellows.  Nice handling of the buildings and their reflections.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-23 22:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690211, 1259718, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image, due to fine processing, could have been taken in the 1930''s American Dust Bowl.  However the headline came to be attached to the photo, it''s timely and heartbreaking.  As this transpires, I imagine I can hear the champagne flutes clinking in the house upon the hill.  To write the op ed, so pardon me.  Anyway, it''s a very handsome photo</td>', 'This image, due to fine processing, could have been taken in the 1930''s American Dust Bowl.  However the headline came to be attached to the photo, it''s timely and heartbreaking.  As this transpires, I imagine I can hear the champagne flutes clinking in the house upon the hill.  To write the op ed, so pardon me.  Anyway, it''s a very handsome photo', '2021-03-23 22:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690213, 1259900, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific illustration of the results of the lockdown.  The emptiness is perfectly conveyed by the depth of field and the receding warp and weft of desolation. <br/>The only "living" presence is the dancing lines of reflected ceiling lights.  All dressed up and no place to go.  Very strong.</td>', 'This is a terrific illustration of the results of the lockdown.  The emptiness is perfectly conveyed by the depth of field and the receding warp and weft of desolation. The only "living" presence is the dancing lines of reflected ceiling lights.  All dressed up and no place to go.  Very strong.', '2021-03-23 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7690223, 1259718, 114285, '<td valign="top">I think you were robbed of the Blue ribbon.<br/>In my humble opinion of course.<br/></td>', 'I think you were robbed of the Blue ribbon.In my humble opinion of course.', '2021-03-24 01:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
